    "media:imagetext": "Ransome Airlines\nDE HAVILLAND DASH-7\nThe Dash-7 is a 50-passenger, pressurized 4-engine jet-prop\nairliner. It carries a crew of two and a flight attendant. This\nmodern aircraft contains the latest computerized\ncontrol systems, and can land and take-off in less than 1,000\nfeet. Ransome Airlines operates a fleet of Dash-7s between\nmajor cities in the Northeastern United States.\nPublished by Aviation World, Inc., P.O. Box 188\nBethel.\nConn. 06801 U.S.A.\nAvion Foto by Jay Selman\n2-009\n80501-0\npost card\n2015.166.1328",
